<slide>
  text-size: 3.8vmin
</slide>

<h2>Slide drawer and export</h2>

<ul>
  <li>
    <b>o</b> (or the ☰ button that appears when you move the mouse) opens the drawer: a thumbnail of every slide,
    the current one highlighted. Click to jump; <b>Esc</b> or <b>o</b> closes it
  </li>
  <li><c>?print=slides</c> — one page per slide, <c>?print=steps</c> — one page per animation step; then <i>Print → Save as PDF</i></li>
  <li>or from the command line: <c>slideit build deck/ -t pdf [--steps]</c></li>
</ul>
